** {ATTACH(name=>lojbanbrochure.pdf)}{ATTACH} - 8.5"x11"
** {ATTACH(name=>lojbanbrochurea4.pdf)}{ATTACH} - A4
* French
** {ATTACH(name=>lojbanbrochurea4-fr.pdf)}{ATTACH} - A4 Text by Greg Dyke
** {ATTACH(name=>lojbanbrochurea4-fr-greg.pdf)}{ATTACH} - A4 Text by Greg Dyke, with Greg Dyke's contact info (as he's offered to deal with French Lojbanists)
